{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2d88cd2db8d01013cab8c818fec8dbbd7d496407778ca3f11f592e2382cff27e","ja":"思わぬ落とし穴","zh":"意想不到的陷阱","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c3bf3631462298800fe48612bbcbd50c37c325c3f06a48e2999774e642e3f580","ja":"「それでは、次の公演を引き継ぐ皆さんへ\n一言、お願いします！」","zh":"“那么，请对接替下一场演出的各位\n说上一句吧！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cf2c79322b2adde7097e1c7a23aa8f0ea75840388d1fe7ae2f0d6cf355685b21","ja":"はい！　真珠星はもちろんだけど、他の子達も\n私達に負けないくらいに輝かせてください！","zh":"好的！真珠星自不必说，其他孩子也\n请让他们散发出不输给我们的光彩！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"15587ee7ec782741a370bc828d978b3d5edf389cb598cf168d1c506f00aedf91","ja":"クロエは、新しく登場したばかりの子ですが、\n魅力的な子に作り上げていってください。","zh":"克洛伊虽然是个刚登场不久的孩子，\n但还请将她塑造成一个充满魅力的孩子。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"fdaf5b130a44c0b0f168c0bfbc5d1fdbb726f6d15fb0815ae67b51bc166cd9f8","ja":"「予定にないことまで聞いてしまいましたが、\nお答えいただき、ありがとうございました！」","zh":"「问了计划之外的问题，\n非常感谢您的回答！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"680b68b58bf73e409e902f63a2fa76f8424453fd24934d5043bce74cd71fed4f","ja":"ううっ。おふたりがこんなにも堂々と答えられる姿を\n真横で拝見できるなんて……ありさ、感動で……。","zh":"呜呜。竟然能在正旁边看到两位如此\n堂堂正正作答的身姿……亚利沙太感动了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"07848614ef907cd8b7966efcf44470101f0c12693ccb4802b84b858800179a25","ja":"「それでは、最後に松田さん。\nこの劇の最後はどのようになると思いますか？」","zh":"「那么，最后有请松田小姐。\n你觉得这出戏的结局会是怎样的呢？」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"67725fd20ddd3c5517804d7392a1b8f848c981dd454d444ffab2bf8605125c25","ja":"ふえっ！　あ、ありさですか！？\nちょ、ちょっと待ってください！","zh":"咦！　亚、亚利沙吗！？\n请、请等一下！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"ecb299cbff53fc0c688fac7446c22f6126400aeb804c32753557a2a47756d014","ja":"えっと、その……あ、ありさには全く想像がつきません！\nだ、だから、今後の楽しみで、え～っと……。","zh":"那个，这个……亚、亚利沙完全想象不出来！\n所、所以，就当作今后的期待，那个……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"199b9ec64dad008b380bbb1ab6239d79eb8330ed2afc18307e32d3a48d71ea5e","ja":"「すみません、お時間になってしまいました。\n今日の放送はここまで！　さようなら～！」","zh":"“不好意思，时间已经到了。\n今天的播出就到这里！大家再见啦～！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"715428790cb04ec9186d543b9273aa4069771639e84f88dd1b29249fe13e5088","ja":"あぁぁっ！　おふたりの立派なお姿に集中するあまり、\n最後の最後に失敗してしまいましたぁ～！","zh":"啊啊啊！我光顾着专心看两位英姿飒爽的身姿，\n结果在最后的关头搞砸了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"4b7a9ef45759e89ea93550d16da140d98f66dc1ef77b0346c6e293c716ac24ed","ja":"おふたりにいろいろと言ってきたのに、\nお恥ずかしいです～……。","zh":"明明对你们两位说了那么多，\n真不好意思～……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"0fe3ecc013a2041d0dd491a213f184593ffe32fc8e04339d7004155313c70702","ja":"あ、亜利沙ちゃん、すごく焦ってたから……、\n私も、びっくりしちゃった。","zh":"啊、亚利沙非常焦急的样子……\n我也吓了一跳呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"acaab030d7799488c9a0085480ee6863077ba94cc2c8716e731ef73a1c8d4c00","ja":"ふふっ、今度は亜利沙ちゃんが特訓しないと、だね！\n私がビシバシ鍛えてあげるよ！","zh":"呵呵，下次就轮到亚利沙进行特训了呢！\n就由我来狠狠锻炼你一番吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1444.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"d1db25a4bdebb5b4253916a1123ca9f27e8b6b5926d9a27b26b1f54f2ca2734a","ja":"ううっ……嬉しいです～！　でも、恥ずかしい気持ちも\n入り混じっていて……ありさ、複雑です～！","zh":"呜呜……好开心～！但害羞的心情也\n交织在一起……亚利沙现在好复杂哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
